---
import Site from '../../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site title="Privacy">
	<div class="content-wrap prose">
		<h1>Privacy</h1>
		<p>Last updated: <time datetime="2026-05-15">May 15, 2026</time>.</p>
		<h2>Short version</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Jeo doesn't require an account to play.</li>
			<li>Your favorites, history, saves, and settings stay in your browser by default.</li>
			<li>If you create an account, your profile is encrypted client-side. We never see plaintext.</li>
			<li>If you opt into cloud sync, your encrypted blob is mirrored on our server. We can't read it.</li>
			<li>Analytics (page views, anonymized play events) are on by default and can be turned off in Settings → Privacy &amp; Data.</li>
		</ul>
		<h2>What we collect</h2>
		<p>
			When analytics is enabled, we collect aggregated and anonymized usage data (which games are played, how long,
			which features are used). We do not collect personally identifiable information unless you explicitly provide it.
		</p>
		<h2>Third parties</h2>
		<p>
			Some pages use third-party scripts (ad networks, analytics). You can opt out of every category in
			Settings → Privacy &amp; Data, which sets a cookie that suppresses those scripts on subsequent loads.
		</p>
		<h2>Your data, your control</h2>
		<p>
			You can export your full profile (favorites, saves, settings) as a .jeo file at any time. You can delete it
			by clearing site data in your browser, or by clicking "Delete account" in the account menu (irreversible).
		</p>
	</div>
</Site>

<style>
	.prose { max-width: var(--max-w-prose); padding-top: var(--space-7); }
	.prose h1 { font-size: var(--text-h1); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
	.prose h2 { font-size: var(--text-h2); margin: var(--space-7) 0 var(--space-3); }
	.prose p, .prose li { color: var(--fg-1); line-height: var(--leading-loose); }
	.prose ul { list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5em; margin: var(--space-3) 0; }
	.prose li + li { margin-top: var(--space-2); }
</style>
